{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/sets/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/sets.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Sets — notation & Venn diagrams","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white py-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"font-semibold\">Sets</div><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/number-systems/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a></div></header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Basics</h2><div class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">Union (A ∪ B), intersection (A ∩ B), complement, subset notation. Use Venn diagrams to visualize.</div></section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Venn Diagram</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-gray-700\">Example with A={1,2,3}, B={2,3,4}.</div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 flex justify-center\">\n        <svg width=\"320\" height=\"120\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#2563eb\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#be185d\"></circle>\n          <text x=\"92\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#063970\">1</text>\n          <text x=\"148\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#063970\">2,3</text>\n          <text x=\"232\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6b0b3a\">4</text>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">1) A ∪ B ? (A={1,2,3},B={2,3,4})</div><input id=\"s1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1,2,3,4\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"sc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"sh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"sfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\"><div class=\"font-medium\">2) A ∩ B ?</div><input id=\"s2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 2,3\"><div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"sc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-teal-700 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"sh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div><div id=\"sfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"sQuiz\" class=\"bg-teal-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"sModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\"><div id=\"sContent\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"sClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div></div></div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-teal-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}